*Released product: likely not affected.* Confidence: moderate. Grounding: not-shipped. Likely not affected. glob 10.5.0 is in the 3.2.2 lockfile only through dev/test edges (private @mongodb\-js/mcp\-test\-utils \-> testcontainers \-> archiver \-> archiver\-utils), and the published tarball ships only dist/\*\* with no bundled dependencies, so the server's runtime closure contains no glob. The other glob copy is 7.2.3, below the affected 9.0.0\+ range.

